<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Better Sleep Habits - Tellngrow</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen">
  {{> sidebar}}
  
  <nav class="bg-white shadow-md p-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
        <button onclick="openSidebar()" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-purple-600 focus:outline-none">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-600">🌱 Tellngrow</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container mx-auto p-6 max-w-4xl">
    <a href="/reading" class="inline-flex items-center text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 mb-6">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to Reading Materials
    </a>

    <article class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs bg-orange-100 text-orange-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Wellness</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">5 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">😴 Better Sleep Habits</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Tips for improving sleep quality and establishing healthy sleep routines.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-500 rounded-lg mb-8 flex items-center justify-center">
        <span class="text-8xl">😴</span>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Why Sleep Matters</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Quality sleep is essential for physical health, mental well-being, and overall quality of life. During sleep, your body repairs itself, consolidates memories, and regulates hormones that affect mood and stress levels.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Sleep Hygiene Tips</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">1. Stick to a Schedule</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Go to bed and wake up at the same time every day, even on weekends. This helps regulate your body's internal clock.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2. Create a Bedtime Routine</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Develop a relaxing pre-sleep routine: take a warm bath, read a book, or practice gentle stretching. Avoid screens 1 hour before bed.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3. Optimize Your Environment</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-4">
          <li>Keep your bedroom cool (60-67°F / 15-19°C)</li>
          <li>Make it dark with blackout curtains</li>
          <li>Reduce noise with earplugs or white noise</li>
          <li>Invest in a comfortable mattress and pillows</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">4. Watch What You Consume</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Avoid caffeine after 2 PM, limit alcohol, and don't eat heavy meals close to bedtime. If hungry, have a light snack.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-6 my-8">
          <p class="text-orange-900 font-semibold mb-2">💡 Quick Tip:</p>
          <p class="text-orange-800">
            If you can't fall asleep after 20 minutes, get up and do a quiet activity until you feel sleepy. Don't lie in bed awake.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
